  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 203.08 Date of Filing. Filings shall be deemed filed on the date that the commission receives them, if submitted during the commission’s business hours listed in Puc 203.03. A filing submitted after hours shall be deemed to have been filed on the next business day.\n\nSource. #2011, eff 5-4-82; ss by #2912, eff 11-26-84; ss by #4998, eff 11-26-90; ss by #6365, INTERIM, eff 11-18-96, EXPIRED: 3-18-97\n\nNew. #6559, eff 8-19-97, EXPIRED: 8-19-05\n\nNew. #8420, INTERIM, eff 8-23-05, EXPIRED: 2-19-06\n\nNew. #8657-A, eff 6-10-06; ss by #9897, INTERIM, eff 3-26-11, EXPIRED: 9-22-11\n\nNew. #10101, eff 3-24-12\n\nNew. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 202.05)",
